# nbfc-xfce4-tray

**nbfc-xfce4-tray** is a simple Gtk-based XFCE4 Panel Plugin for [nbfc-linux](https://github.com/nbfc-linux/nbfc-linux).

It is written in C.

Installation
------------

### Packages

| Operating System      | Download                       | Command                                        |
|-----------------------|--------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------
| Arch Linux            | [%TAG%](%ARCHLINUX_URL%)       | `sudo pacman -U ./%ARCHLINUX_PACKAGE%`         |
| Debian Trixie         | [%TAG%](%DEBIAN_TRIXIE_URL%)   | `sudo apt install ./%DEBIAN_TRIXIE_PACKAGE%`   |
| Debian Bookworm       | [%TAG%](%DEBIAN_BOOKWORM_URL%) | `sudo apt install ./%DEBIAN_BOOKWORM_PACKAGE%` |
| Ubuntu Noble          | [%TAG%](%UBUNTU_NOBLE_URL%)    | `sudo apt install ./%UBUNTU_NOBLE_PACKAGE%`    |
| Ubuntu Jammy          | [%TAG%](%UBUNTU_JAMMY_URL%)    | `sudo apt install ./%UBUNTU_JAMMY_PACKAGE%`    |
| Linux Mint 22         | [%TAG%](%LINUX_MINT_22_URL%)   | `sudo apt install ./%LINUX_MINT_22_PACKAGE%`   |
| Linux Mint 21         | [%TAG%](%LINUX_MINT_21_URL%)   | `sudo apt install ./%LINUX_MINT_21_PACKAGE%`   |
| Fedora 44             | [%TAG%](%FEDORA_44_URL%)       | `sudo dnf install ./%FEDORA_44_PACKAGE%`       |
| Fedora 43             | [%TAG%](%FEDORA_43_URL%)       | `sudo dnf install ./%FEDORA_43_PACKAGE%`       |
| OpenSuse (Tumbleweed) | [%TAG%](%OPENSUSE_URL%)        | `sudo zypper install ./%OPENSUSE_PACKAGE%`     |

Usage
-----

After installing the plugin, the panel has to be restarted:

```sh
xfce4-panel -r
```

The plugin can be added by right-clicking the panel then clicking `Panel -> Add new items`
and selecting the `NBFC` plugin.
